{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1330.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"2be608d6cb25c3b36ebcbe6cb58d7dfe51b982d47d6a68cdf7491e046c0c537b","ja":"かわいくデコろう！","zh":"装饰得可爱一点吧！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1330.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"092a5aa3c823a96fcda0d7836f5649477b66e0877ed2cd0b12ca9a81ab88b172","ja":"ミキは、携帯をデコるの♪\n杏奈とひなたは、何にするか決まったの？","zh":"美希要装饰手机♪\n杏奈和日向，决定好要做什么了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1330.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"61f8485cb3104bbccfa53d0838f21e70cb00990fbc49887315fb40e5b7773675","ja":"杏奈……は、コントローラーにした、よ……。\nかわいくデコって、クラスアップ……♪","zh":"杏奈……选了手柄、哦……。\n装饰得可可爱爱的，提升等级……♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1330.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"a8a9c700c3d25c39819ab5d624fada5923c5373c7ede3a99f50d32cc61b73ffb","ja":"あたしは家庭菜園で使ってるスコップにしたんだぁ。\nいつものお礼に、かわいくしてあげたくってねぇ。","zh":"我选的是在家庭菜园用的小铁锹哦。\n为了答谢它平时的功劳，就想着要把它装饰得可爱一点呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1330.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"f993c6e0b89453fe08b875014513fa5db740531e520fc460bbe15392138d07dc","ja":"あはっ☆　ふたりとも、\nどんなカンジになるかすっごく楽しみなの♪","zh":"啊哈☆　好期待两个人\n会变成什么样子哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1330.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"a01d4fb139591a43cd75122dbcd0d61e7b95bd3d89f6bad327cd543c40aaba57","ja":"でも、ミキも負けてられないって思うな。\nそれじゃあ早速始めるの♪","zh":"不过，美希也觉得不能认输呢。\n那么就马上开始吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1330.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"88c8cdd034c1b50aceec94cf7345017c50db49247d38fe367093d28217cba40a","ja":"あっ……ボタンのデコ……どうしよ。\n押すとき、指……痛くならないかな……？","zh":"啊……按键的装饰……怎么办呢。\n按的时候，手指……会不会痛啊……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1330.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"1f8c74a0108edc3b2396ee050be9e25d24eda3c44d35cb122dcd1614cbe8d118","ja":"使うことを考えたら、飾り付けられる所は\n限られてきちゃうんだねぇ。","zh":"考虑到还要使用，能装饰的地方\n可就受限了呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1330.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"1276272ff9784518c361c531c80aa88dc1a566729eacc0c394f370b0d66a3970","ja":"ミキは、ちゃんと使えて……、\nかわいく見えるようにして……んっ、完成なの♪","zh":"美希要好好用上它……\n然后再弄得好看可爱一点……嗯，完成啦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1330.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"d2f893ad0107e7b192680d31fae1c941182eb602e622160e40d29d63749ed28b","ja":"わぁ……美希さんの、すごくかわいいねぇ。\nでも、あたしも負けてないよぉ。","zh":"哇……美希的，好可爱呀。\n不过，我也不会认输的哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1330.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"b16b59f8afafd7999647700a9d0b8055ade350f5d3a2f9c36bb94132c6724fe1","ja":"持つ所と土に触れる所以外を飾ってみたんだぁ。\n今から使うのが楽しみだべさ。","zh":"我把除了握持的地方和碰土的地方以外都装饰了一下。\n现在就期待用它了呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1330.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"9f0a4b2bc7c666f36a7b59b4780803a68b79a94e5e263aec213254c898c5896b","ja":"えへへ……杏奈も、完成、したよ……。今日から\nこのコントローラーでプレイ……決定……。","zh":"嘿嘿……杏奈的也，做完，了哦……。决定……从今天起\n就用这个手柄玩……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1330.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"90c3958ab22481bba15dcbb4b5c7eef40d1758277e00f944efdf41083c0931aa","ja":"かわいい持ち物を装備してると……なんだか、\n気分がすごく上がっちゃう、ね……♪","zh":"装备着可爱的随身物品……不知为何，\n心情就会变得特别棒，呢……♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1330.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"e6f3d34f7030ac774b461f492af927aa150466ea8627054ff4a899708107fb7f","ja":"そうだねぇ。せっかくだし、\n他のみんなにも見てもらいたいべさ♪","zh":"是呀。机会难得，\n也想让其他人都来看看呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1330.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"070abf02cad6fc40e3aeedc453f4ff23d00bf1e2106a60c7dd66bb3537c4e1d2","ja":"うん！　それじゃあ、今からみんなに見せに行くの☆","zh":"嗯！那我这就去给大家看☆","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
